              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Version 3.1.4-r2 is affected with an available fix in versions 3.1.7-r0"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-6119\nSeverity: high\nPackage: libcrypto3\nVersion: 3.1.4-r2\nFix Version: 3.1.7-r0\nType: apk\nLocation: /lib/apk/db/installed\nData Namespace: alpine:distro:alpine:3.19\nLink: [CVE-2024-6119](https://security.alpinelinux.org/vuln/CVE-2024-6119)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-6119**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| high  | libcrypto3  | 3.1.4-r2  | 3.1.7-r0  | apk  | /lib/apk/db/installed  | alpine:distro:alpine:3.19  | [CVE-2024-6119](https://security.alpinelinux.org/vuln/CVE-2024-6119)  |\n"
              },
